# Del on the item list asks about the item by its ID, maker and model as
# the row shows them (runs of blanks squeezed); N keeps the item and Y
# deletes it.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T I
K DOWN DEL
S ASK2
T N
S KEPT2
K DOWN DEL
S ASK3
T N
S KEPT3
K UP DEL
T Y
S GONE
# The same in the other orders of the list.
K ESC ALT-I
T I
K ALT-I L DEL
S ORDLOC
T N
K ALT-I M DEL
S ORDMKR
T N
K ALT-I S DEL
S ORDSER
T N
